  "title": "Roasted Tajin Pumpkin Seeds",
  "description": "This roasted Tajin pumpkin seed recipe only combines oil, pumpkin seeds, salt, and chili-lime seasoning to create a flavorful, crunchy autumn snack.",
  "authors": [
    "Suzie Lopez O'Connor"
  ],
